        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;rounded=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;RLinf PPO Training (Single-Node)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- VLA policy (7B) with FSDP across 8 H200 GPUs&lt;br&gt;- GPU-accelerated simulator (ManiSkill3 or LIBERO)&lt;br&gt;- All RL components colocated in one K8s Job&lt;br&gt;- ManiSkill: split (actor 0-7, env 0-3, rollout 4-7)&lt;br&gt;- LIBERO/pi0: combined (all roles on all GPUs)&lt;br&gt;- Checkpoint + model weights on FSx for Lustre&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
